  data: {
    LLM: "Count your points! Every card matters in a 20-card deck. Know when you have reached 66 so you can stop the hand before your opponents gain more points.\n\nThe 'Volle' Strategy: Focus on capturing the Tens and Aces (the Volle). In a stripped deck, these 10/11 point cards are the difference between victory and defeat.\n\nBidding Precision: Understanding when to bid 'Gang' (winning all 5 tricks) vs 'Normal' requires perfect reading of the distribution based on the 3-card initial deal.",
